# ---------- Required mod info ---------------

icon                "AngelicSavior.tga"
description         "The angels of the Celestial Plane have seen the way the humans have conducted themselves within Elysium. Looking upon this, a decree has been put forth for a few angels to take up the role of a lord and decend down upon the plane to bring all within the fold of El."

